<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A13" title="In Appendix ‣ One Model, Many Budgets: Elastic Latent Interfaces for Diffusion Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">M </span>Failed Experiments</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
